{
    "name": "戶外活動",
    "data": {
        "phase1": [
            {
                "text": "今天是星期六。主角正在和哥哥聊天，<br>討論明天的行程。來看看他們要去哪裡玩吧！"
            },
            {
                "text": "sulja ripaitin nu tjiyau aru mainu sun",
                "textCh": "sulja，明天是星期天，你打算去哪裡？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65670/918488",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "aru vaik aken ka tji selep a mapana a kivangevang",
                "textCh": "我明天要和selep去溪邊烤肉，你呢？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65670/918489",
                "image": "boy-2.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "ku nanguaq nu tja kenemenemin makaya ken a kiyan tjanumun",
                "textCh": "聽起來很好玩！我也可以一起去嗎？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65670/918490",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "kiva’daqu anan tji kina",
                "textCh": "你先問媽媽！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65670/918491",
                "image": "boy-2.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "kina makaya aken a kiyan tjai kaka a mapana a kivangevang",
                "textCh": "媽媽，我可以跟哥哥一起去溪邊嗎？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65670/918492",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "makaya ljakua kipa paulingauvu",
                "textCh": "可以，但你們要小心喔！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65670/918493",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-3.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "maljimalji tjara kipa paulingau amen",
                "textCh": "沒問題，我們一定會的！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65670/918494",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            }
        ],
